# Copy to .env for local development. Never commit real secrets.
# Generate a unique high-entropy secret (at least 32 random bytes) for each environment.
JWT_SECRET=replace-with-a-unique-random-secret-of-at-least-32-characters

# Comma-separated exact browser origins allowed to call the API.
# Replace with the actual deployed PWA origin before production use.
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173

# Hosting providers commonly set PORT automatically; local default is 3000.
PORT=3000

# IMPORTANT: The current backend still uses SQLite dev.db in app.module.ts.
# Persistent production database support and migration reconciliation are not
# included in this preflight change. Do not deploy production traffic until resolved.
